  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUNPROMA-shall in cooperation with the Municipality of Quetzaltenango organize a campaign for tolerance among ethnic groups. In this work media will be the key actor but work will also be done in schools.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FUNPROMA-skall i samarbete med Quetzaltenagos kommun genomf&#xf6;ra en kampanj mot rasism och f&#xf6;r tolerans. I detta arbete skall man framf&#xf6;r-allt anv&#xe4;nda sig av massmedia men ocks&#xe5; g&#xf6;ra program i skolor.</narrative>
